@startuml
!include _theme.iuml
hide empty description
<style>
stateDiagram {
  circle {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #FFFFFF
  }
}
</style>
skinparam StateStartColor #FFFFFF
skinparam StateEndColor #FFFFFF
title State Diagram — Lifecycle of a Transaction
[*] --> Received : POST /transactions/analyze
Received --> Rejected : schema validation fails (422)
Received --> Scoring : payload valid
Scoring : rule engine and graph analyzer
Scoring : run concurrently
Scoring --> Rejected : tx_id already stored (409)
Scoring --> Provisional : record inserted
Provisional : banded on rule + graph score
Provisional : rag_pending = true
Provisional --> Final : model returns score and explanation
Provisional --> Final : model error or 180 s timeout,\nprovisional decision kept
state Final {
  [*] --> Approved : composite below 40
  [*] --> UnderReview : composite 40–69
  [*] --> Blocked : composite 70 or above
  UnderReview --> Approved : analyst approves\n(X-API-Key)
  UnderReview --> Blocked : analyst blocks\n(X-API-Key)
}
Rejected --> [*]
@enduml
